  "fullPrompt": "Human: \nYou are an expert in Prometheus and Grafana.\nBased on the User Selected SLOs, generate:\n1. A Prometheus Rule (YAML) containing recording rules and alerting rules for these SLOs.\n2. A Grafana Dashboard (JSON) to visualize these SLOs.\n\nUser Selected SLOs:\n[\n  {\n    \"id\": \"slo-001\",\n    \"name\": \"API Availability\",\n    \"description\": \"Measures the percentage of successful responses from the guestbook UI API over a specified time period.\",\n    \"target\": 99.9,\n    \"window\": \"30d\",\n    \"golden_signal\": \"Errors\",\n    \"description_zh\": \"這個指標衡量在特定時間內，guestbook UI API 的成功響應百分比。這對用戶來說非常重要，因為它確保了應用程序的可用性，讓用戶能夠順利使用服務。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"slo-002\",\n    \"name\": \"API Latency\",\n    \"description\": \"Measures the response time of the guestbook UI API, indicating how quickly the service responds to requests.\",\n    \"target\": 200,\n    \"window\": \"30d\",\n    \"golden_signal\": \"Latency\",\n    \"description_zh\": \"這個指標衡量 guestbook UI API 的響應時間，顯示服務對請求的反應速度。對用戶來說，快速的響應時間意味著更好的使用體驗，特別是在高流量時期。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"slo-003\",\n    \"name\": \"Service Traffic\",\n    \"description\": \"Measures the number of requests received by the guestbook UI service over a specified time period.\",\n    \"target\": 10000,\n    \"window\": \"30d\",\n    \"golden_signal\": \"Traffic\",\n    \"description_zh\": \"這個指標衡量在特定時間內，guestbook UI 服務接收到的請求數量。這對於了解服務的使用情況和流量模式非常重要，幫助團隊進行資源規劃。\"\n  }\n]\n\nEnsure the PromQL queries are valid and follow best practices.\nAssume standard metrics are available (e.g., kube-state-metrics, ingress-nginx, or typical application metrics 'http_requests_total', 'container_cpu_usage_seconds_total').\nIf specific metric names are unknown, use placeholders like 'http_requests_total{job=\"app\"}' but try to be as generic as possible for K8s.\n\nProvide the output as a JSON object with two keys: \"prometheus_yaml\" and \"grafana_json\".\n"
}
